# Advisories accepted for the image scan, each with its reason. Review on every release.

# python-engineio 4.9.1 / python-socketio 5.11.2: pyATS 26.10 pins engineio<4.10 and socketio<5.11.3
# for its log viewer. Assurance never starts a Socket.IO server, so the DoS paths are unreachable.
